// Shared setup: requires an existing graphics window.
// First row: Standing. Second row: Walking. Frames are 64x64, row-major.
Graphics Load_Animation Adam Standing Examples/Characters/Adam_Movement.png 64 64 0 8
Graphics Load_Animation Adam Walking Examples/Characters/Adam_Movement.png 64 64 8 8
Graphics Load_Animation Eve Standing Examples/Characters/Eve_Movement.png 64 64 0 8
Graphics Load_Animation Eve Walking Examples/Characters/Eve_Movement.png 64 64 8 8
Graphics Set_Animation_FPS Adam Standing 7
Graphics Set_Animation_FPS Eve Standing 7
Graphics Set_Animation_FPS Adam Walking 10
Graphics Set_Animation_FPS Eve Walking 10

Graphics Set_Scale Adam 3 3 1
// Negative width mirrors Eve; offset X by her 192-pixel display width.
Graphics Set_Scale Eve -3 3 1
Graphics Rotate Adam 0 0 0
Graphics Rotate Eve 0 0 0
Graphics Paste Adam 176 204 0
Graphics Paste Eve 624 204 0

Return
